    "long_instructions": "Find bigrams in a sentence from *The Raven* by Edgar Allan Poe.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n- Complete the `get_bigrams` function. Given a list of tokens, the function should return a list of bigrams.\r\n\r\n**💻 Coding Tip**\r\n\r\nRemember you can iterate over the index of every token, except the last one, with a `for` loop.\r\n\r\n```\r\nfor i in range(len(tokens) - 1):\r\n  ...\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlso remember you can create a tuple as follows:\r\n\r\n```\r\n(value1, value2)\r\n```",
